WEBVTT

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.170
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.950
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.280
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.120
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.820
With you guys

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.820
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:49.490
If we join forces

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:52.460
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:55.800
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:02.970
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:09.110
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.180
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.120
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:17.260
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:22.430
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:25.430
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.130
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:33.170
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:36.040
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:40.040
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.250
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:50.460
Someone once said...

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.760
There are sweet cluster‐amaryllises 
that smell and taste

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:56.330
like fully ripened bananas...

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:01.070
Cluster Bananaryllis!

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:07.070
There is a mollusk that looks just like 
a bean jam wafer because its shell

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:09.910
is crammed full of first-rate bean jam...

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:13.950
Bean Jamollusk Wafer!

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:18.780
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:23.790
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:28.760
The true form of the Four-Beasts 
invaded the Human World!

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:30.900
The Four Kings hurried to capture it.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.670
The Four-Beasts absorbed 
each of its four Beasts

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:39.040
and transformed into its 
gigantic integrated form.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:42.310
This is Green Rain!

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:45.680
Otherwise known as "Malady Rain".

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:49.710
It's poisonous to the human 
body and if you get wet,

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:51.750
you'll have less than an hour to live.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:55.290
Komatsu rushed over to Meal 
King Yuda's restaurant

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:57.790
in order to make a dish that 
would serve as an antidote,

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:58.590
but...

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:03.330
Making enough for hundreds of 
millions of people in one hour,

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:06.860
that's not even one millimeter's 
worth of the time that's necessary.

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:09.000
Amid the Green Rain,

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:13.540
the Four Kings were tossed around by 
the Four-Beasts' overwhelming power.

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:20.480
The Four Kings' Toughest 
Predicament! Komatsu's Resolve!

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:43.330
Toriko!

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:47.540
The Four-Beasts' Capture Level is 
a lot worse than I was afraid of!

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:50.040
At first, it was over over 300,

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:53.110
but now it's 350 and rising!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.110
350...

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:57.950
I buy that.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:19.000
After all...

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:23.070
After all, we're chefs, aren't we?!

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.780
It's just impossible.

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:29.010
The two of us alone can't do it.

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.180
But...

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:34.650
Yuda-chan! Komatsu-kun!

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:39.020
We'll help you with the poison antidote dish.

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.390
Setsuno-san!

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.230
Yun!

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.900
He was gloomy all the way here,

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:52.100
but now I'm glad we brought him along.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.540
Thank you!

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:55.540
Well, well!

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.510
The Gourmet National Treasure,

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:58.410
Setsuno-sama!

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:02.010
I can't think of anyone more 
reliable who could have come.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:03.880
Still...

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:08.020
To be honest, it still isn't enough.

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:10.920
We don't have even one millimeter's 
worth of the chefs that we need.

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:12.120
Oh, no!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.760
I thought that might be 
the case, so I flew over.

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:22.400
I don't know how much good I can do,

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:27.640
Chiru, Head Chef of Vanishing Japanese Cuisine (World Chef Ranking: 15th place)

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.470
but please let me help.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.640
Chiru-san!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:32.740
Chiru, the head chef of 
Vanishing Japanese Cuisine!

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:36.410
Looks like you're in a spot 
of trouble, Koma-chan.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:41.950
Livebearer-san! You came!

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:45.420
Livebearer, Owner of a Gourmet Casino (World Chef Ranking: 17th place)

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:45.390
I can be of help too.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:48.960
Livebearer, the boss of the 
underground cooking world!

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:53.330
Make that "former boss". I've washed 
my hands of all illegal operations.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.500
Oh, I didn't know!

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:59.000
Right now, my plate is full with 
business that's aboveboard.

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:01.670
And it's thanks to Koma-chan!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:04.280
Aw, I didn't do anything...

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:07.110
This is an impressive gathering.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:10.580
But I think you still need more chefs.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.650
I-I know them!

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:18.520
Dhamala Sky the 13th, Owner of Dhamala's Curry (World Chef Ranking: 45th)

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:18.990
Dhamala Sky the 13th, the 
owner-chef of Dhamala's Curry!

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:22.390
Lulubu, Owner of Guts (World Chef Ranking: 22nd)

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.560
Chef Lulubu, the owner of Guts!

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:26.160
Mama Tsurara, Owner of Snack Tsurara (World Chef Ranking: 31st)

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.530
Mama Tsurara of Snack Tsurara!

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:30.900
Sumire, Lunch Lady at Nakaume Culinary School (World Chef Ranking: 10)

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:30.840
Chef Sumire, the lunch lady 
at Nakaume Culinary School!

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:36.670
For all of these fantastic 
chefs to gather together...

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.850
It's like a dream come true!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:44.980
But... Huh?

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:49.250
How do all of you know about 
the poison antidote dish?

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:50.920
I told them.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:53.420
Johannes-san!

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:57.100
To be honest, I wanted to 
gather many more members,

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:02.430
but at present, the people in this room 
were the only first-rate chefs around.

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:05.740
It can't be helped in an 
emergency situation like this.

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:09.410
More importantly, there's no time to waste.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.640
We'll just have to do it with 
the members we have now.

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:17.580
Let's leave the Four-Beasts to the 
Gourmet Hunters while we chefs

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.280
do the work that we're cut out for!

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:21.590
Right!

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:22.750
Alright then.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:27.360
I'll teach you how to make Yuda's 
secret poison antidote dish.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:54.620
Endorphin Smoke!

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:05.160
Are you alright?!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:06.460
Toriko!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.030
Bro, everyone else, are you okay?!

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:09.570
Thank you,

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:10.640
Rin!

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:14.040
Sheesh.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:17.940
That thing's a cocky bastard.

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:21.710
With a 350 Capture Level, you gotta 
figure it ain't gonna go down easy.

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:24.780
So what should we do?

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:28.590
Ain't nothin' to think about! 
We just gotta beat it ASAP!

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:31.790
Charging in carelessly again will 
only garner the same result.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:33.460
Yeah, but still,

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:36.230
what other choice do we have?

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:40.800
Rin...

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:44.640
Get away from here.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.670
Help the people who are wet 
from the rain take shelter.

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.520
What's this?

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.090
An Umbrella Tree.

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:13.260
There are still many people getting 
rained on who don't know it's poisonous.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.200
If we don't get them evacuated right away...

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.170
Teppei!

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.740
The Reviver!

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:25.080
Whoa. There's no sense 
in bringing up the past.

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:28.210
This is neither the time nor place for it.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:32.220
So Yosaku and Teppei were the two Revivers

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:36.320
who delivered you to the 
Gourmet Prison, huh, Zebra?

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:48.600
I wonder if this thick fog could 
be used to guard against the rain.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:49.800
Forget it!

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:53.740
I'm going to fight alongside Toriko!

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:56.510
Miss...

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:59.880
If we can thin out the concentration of rain,

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:02.310
it may weaken the poison.

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:04.350
Rin.

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:08.450
Toriko...

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:10.790
I'll tell you one more time.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.790
Get the people who are wet 
from the rain to shelter.

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.260
That's what you can do right now.

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:22.200
And that's your battle.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.430
We're all

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.170
fighting together!

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:26.700
Toriko...

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:32.310
I'm counting on you!

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.080
Got it. I'll try!

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:41.350
Alright!

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:43.890
Don't you die on me, Toriko!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:45.190
Never!

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:48.460
Thanks to your Endorphin Smoke,

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.730
I can hardly feel the pain!

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:56.130
Beat the Four-Beasts! I'm counting on <i>you</i>!

00:10:58.600 --> 00:10:59.970
What the hell, Teppei?!

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:04.080
You're not gonna help us 
defeat the Four-Beasts?!

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.880
Slaying Beasts...

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:09.680
Or in other words, capturing ingredients, 
is the job of Gourmet Hunters.

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:15.420
I don't know who asked you to do this,

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:16.650
but do your job well.

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:19.560
The one who asked us...

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:24.330
...is that sadistic old man!

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:26.200
At this rate,

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.730
the old man will laugh at us!

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:30.970
Alright!

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:32.470
Let's kick the Four-Beasts' ass!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:39.940
Toriko...

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:44.150
That monster has been revived.

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:45.380
I'm positive.

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:50.690
I don't know what their motive 
is, but someone is behind this.

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:51.520
Be careful.

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:55.230
Damn you, old man.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:58.800
Is findin' the mastermind behind 
this part of your request too?

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:03.370
Gotcha!

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:29.460
What the hell?!

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.100
Doesn't look like it's 
going to stop raining...

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:14.170
This is... poison antidote cooking?!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.140
Is it mochi?

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:20.650
Or purple....

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:22.710
It's Medicinal Mochi.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.220
Medicinal Mochi?

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:26.150
By using colored rice

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:30.390
to make mochi that's a complementary 
color to the color of the poison,

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:34.230
it's possible to neutralize the 
effect of the poison in the body.

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:36.930
Complementary color?

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:41.100
I mean two colors that cancel each other out.

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:45.700
For example, if we look at the 12 
colors on the color wheel chart,

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:49.470
the color of Green Rain is 
closest to yellow-green.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:53.110
The color opposite yellow-green is purple.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.950
So purple negates yellow-green.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:58.320
Or put another way, it erases it, right?

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:03.890
The poison of the Green Rain will be 
cancelled out by the purple mochi.

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:06.220
Then let's all get cooking!

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:10.660
With these members, we'll be able 
to mass produce Medicinal Mochi!

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:13.530
Impossible.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.830
Chef Lulubu?

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:21.610
Even if all of us highly skilled 
chefs worked as fast as we can here,

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:24.880
taking into account the time it'll 
take to distribute the mochi,

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:29.250
it's just not possible to make enough 
for hundreds of millions of people.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.180
You're right.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:36.150
Say we needed to make 500 million portions,

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:39.460
we'd only be able to do about 50 million.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:41.130
No...

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.360
Let's get more people!

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:49.070
We can call on my coworkers at the hotel 
and the cooks at your restaurants...

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:51.440
If we can just increase the 
number of people cooking...

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:53.570
That wouldn't work.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.310
Yuda-san! Why not?!

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:59.380
Because it's a Special 
Preparation Ingredient.

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:05.650
You saw me make the sample.

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:15.060
From the balance of the colored rice

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:17.430
to the time it takes to steam,

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:20.260
to the number of times you beat it.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:24.240
Medicinal Mochi is a Special 
Preparation Ingredient,

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:28.310
so you won't succeed if you're even one 
millimeter off with any of these steps.

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:35.510
Unfortunately, even if tens 
of thousands of people came,

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:38.680
no one but us chefs who are 
already here can prepare it.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.720
So out of all the chefs in this area,

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:46.220
we're the only ones who can 
make Medicinal Mochi, right?

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:51.300
It can't be helped.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:56.070
It's necessary to decide on the 50 million 
people who will get the Medicinal Mochi.

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:02.070
We can't...

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:23.900
What's that?

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:25.360
Mist?

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:26.460
What is this?!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.100
What the hell?!

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:30.800
Wait...

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:32.100
Could this be...

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.340
The fog is blocking the rain!

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:48.120
That's...

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:53.590
That's...

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:55.460
...Rin-san!

00:16:57.800 --> 00:16:59.600
In this rain...

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:02.130
Is she...

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:23.290
Cannon...

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:26.160
...Fork!

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:28.290
Hair Leash!

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:34.170
Poison Coating!

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:40.410
Thunder Noise!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:46.980
Did we do it?!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:12.640
The more power we use against it,

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:16.910
the harder it hits us back!

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:34.790
Alright.

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:36.530
It's cruel,

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:40.530
but let's decide on the 50 million 
people who'll get the Medicinal Mochi.

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:43.870
We can't do this!

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:46.700
Are we supposed to just 
let everyone else die?

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:48.310
But right now,

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:49.640
there's no time to do anything else!

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.240
If you people don't start cooking soon,

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:54.250
no one will be saved!

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:03.790
If Medicinal Mochi is a Special 
Preparation Ingredient,

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:08.130
all we have to do is find 
a way to make it simple

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:11.460
for even an ordinary chef to make it!

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:18.240
15 minutes!

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:22.070
No, ten minutes! Ten minutes is fine!

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:25.110
Please give me time!

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:28.280
I swear I'll find a simple 
preparation method!

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:29.310
So...

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:33.150
...please, gather as many 
average chefs as you can here!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:35.050
Please!

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:39.960
This boy's eyes...

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:41.590
...are serious.

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:46.430
Perfect timing.

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:51.970
I just summoned all of the 
cooks in my group of companies.

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:56.770
S-Setsuno-san!

00:19:56.770 --> 00:19:59.540
Give it a shot, Komatsu-kun!

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:01.110
I will!

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:04.450
Still, either way, we don't have time.

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:07.450
The rest of us should start 
making it right away.

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.760
I'm glad I called you here...

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:14.760
You...

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:18.860
Thank you for coming, Tylan.

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:23.000
This is Tylan, a Poison Cuisine chef.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:26.770
He's second to none when it 
comes to handling poison!

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:29.840
Green Rain...

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:32.910
It's impossible to completely 
neutralize the poison,

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:35.610
but slowing down its progress is easy.

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:39.150
That being said, once a person is rained on,

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:41.050
the most I can delay the 
poison is about three hours.

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:44.720
Understood.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:47.590
We'll work on making enough Medicinal 
Mochi for 50 billion people

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:49.630
and get them ready for distribution.

00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:53.030
The amount of time we can 
afford to give Chef Komatsu

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:56.230
is, as we thought, ten minutes.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.970
That's your time limit.

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:02.540
Right! Please leave it to me!

00:21:04.640 --> 00:21:10.550
I have been alone

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:17.890
Ever since that day

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:25.560
All I got was a definite history

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:32.300
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:35.770
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:39.110
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:43.080
A dream is still a dream

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:46.450
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:51.020
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:51.220 --> 00:21:54.590
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:54.790 --> 00:22:02.430
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:08.040
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:08.540 --> 00:22:11.410
Yun is hiding somewhere in the 
image you're about to see,

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:12.540
so please find him!

00:22:12.610 --> 00:22:19.250
Hiding Level 20

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:15.610
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 20!

00:22:15.610 --> 00:22:17.480
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:19.180
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:23.420
Alright, where could Yun be this time?

00:22:23.920 --> 00:22:26.490
Pay attention to the bottom 
half of the screen.

00:22:29.960 --> 00:22:32.330
Yun is... right here!

00:22:38.970 --> 00:22:40.570
How was it?

00:22:41.270 --> 00:22:43.840
Look at that kitchen full 
of incredible chefs.

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:47.950
So I think it would be wise not 
to hide inside an ingredient...

00:22:48.350 --> 00:22:49.980
And now on to our next segment!

00:22:52.130 --> 00:22:53.410
Toriko is on the ropes...

00:22:53.730 --> 00:22:55.780
It looks like we all might be doomed...!

00:22:55.780 --> 00:22:59.110
Komatsu-kun! You're our last hope!

00:22:59.750 --> 00:23:02.170
Save Humankind with Miraculous Gourmet Luck!

00:23:02.390 --> 00:23:04.250
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
